            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Bancorp 34 (BCTF) Swings to Profitability, Challenging Years of Bearish Sentiment",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Bancorp 34 (BCTF) has swung to profitability, as the company\u2019s net profit margin moved from negative to positive over the past year. Despite this milestone, BCTF\u2019s earnings have declined by 7.4% per year over the last five years and the company now trades at a price-to-earnings ratio of 15.6x, which is more expensive than both the US Banks industry average of 11x and its peers at 11.6x. With no confirmation of expected growth ahead, investors are weighing the fresh profit turnaround against...",
